00:20:47.793 --> 00:20:51.253
We want to have that fix
that you can give us.


00:20:51.544 --> 00:20:53.421
When we ask for
forgiveness for whatever


00:20:53.713 --> 00:20:55.799
we've done to somebody--
if we..


00:20:56.090 --> 00:20:58.634
For whatever reason you
